call_translation = "Hey kids! Are you all sat and ready for bee time? [Yes Mary I am ecstatic for bee time. Hooray.] Now let me ask you all, what sound does a dog make? [Mary, I will answer using my supreme intellect. A canine will make the sound (dog_sound.mp3) however humans typically will answer with onomatopoeia saying “woof”, or “ruff”. While technically being incorrect these are close to what dogs sound like. :) ]
Thats right! Bark bark bark! [Predictable answer Mary but thank you for confirming my answer.] Now. What sound does a car make? [Vehicles come in all sorts of different variations Mary, would you like me to list every single vehicle sound that currently exists? Although- Call was canceled abruptly.]
